  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.1.2-beta\n\t\t\t- Removed the redundant net8.0 asset; netstandard2.0 remains available\n\t\t\t  to compatible consumers, including .NET 8. No public API changes.\n\t\t\t- Added Barcode.NewBarcode() and Barcode.Create(DateTimeOffset) for\n\t\t\t  optional, infrequently generated physical-item label payloads.\n\t\t\t- Added BarcodeFormat.UtcTimestamp (default: yyMMdd-HHmm-AAAA) and\n\t\t\t  BarcodeFormat.RandomLetters (AAAAAA-AAAA-AAAA), both 16 characters.\n\t\t\t- Uses cryptographic randomness with unbiased letter sampling;\n\t\t\t  uniqueness is probabilistic, not guaranteed. Generate once and\n\t\t\t  persist the payload for reuse. Barcode/QR rendering is consumer-owned.\n\t\t\t- Added eight focused barcode tests and an opt-in direct MSTest runner.\n\t\t\t- Clarified ToStrongNamedFriendAssembly as a development-time annotation\n\t\t\t  helper. Its existing Type/unsigned-assembly diagnostics are returned\n\t\t\t  strings outside the Throw/Advisory stream; no helper behavior changed\n\t\t\t  in this release.\n\n\t\t\t1.1.x\n\t\t\t- Added enum-driven policy throwing with PolicyAttribute,\n\t\t\t  PolicyEnforcementAttribute, and ThrowPolicyException.\n\t\t\t- Added PolicyError to Throw so consumers can pattern match on\n\t\t\t  the originating enum member.\n\t\t\t- Added PublishedContractAttribute, NotFlagsAttribute, and\n\t\t\t  ClaimAttribute.\n\t\t\t- Added Win32Message and ToStrongNamedFriendAssembly(this object).\n\t\t\t- Added AppDomain TypeCache baseline functionality.",
